        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the role of Autonomous Strategic Mobile Projectile No. 100 (hereinafter referred to as &quot;No. 100&quot;) and strive to conquer the Facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Navigate the Floors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.poster.avif?t=1762819028\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.webm?t=1762819028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.mp4?t=1762819028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touch the black objects to charge energy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this state, press the button to build power and release to launch toward the pointer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can launch up to two times with a single charge.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress to the next area by leaping between black objects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once you reach the goal area, launch No. 100 into the goal to clear the floor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:Some floors may differ from these rules. Adapt as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various gimmicks and physical laws to conquer each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Clear all 15 floors within the time limit to conquer the Facility.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you conquer the Facility, I will grant you one wish.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to see the outside world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 100’s challenge begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the role of Autonomous Strategic Mobile Projectile No. 100 (hereinafter referred to as &quot;No. 100&quot;) and strive to conquer the Facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Navigate the Floors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.poster.avif?t=1762819028\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.webm?t=1762819028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355900/extras/80cd1ed43bab491323780589be192215.mp4?t=1762819028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touch the black objects to charge energy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this state, press the button to build power and release to launch toward the pointer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can launch up to two times with a single charge.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress to the next area by leaping between black objects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once you reach the goal area, launch No. 100 into the goal to clear the floor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:Some floors may differ from these rules. Adapt as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various gimmicks and physical laws to conquer each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Clear all 15 floors within the time limit to conquer the Facility.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you conquer the Facility, I will grant you one wish.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to see the outside world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 100’s challenge begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
